e il giorno (del Ringraziamento). Con amici così buoni, Charlie Brown - e tutti noi - abbiamo tanti motivi per essere grati.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Spend Thanksgiving with good ol' Charlie Brown!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1973-11-20","status":"Released","rating":7.3,"ratingCount":308,"genres":["Animazione","Commedia","Famiglia","televisione film"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"25m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":124048,"name":"Todd Barbee","role":"Charlie Brown (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uIr3Zg9eH1sPtV2VVbte60N50aF.jpg"},{"id":124659,"name":"Robin Kohn","role":"Lucy van Pelt (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Nne24vOgz0t1nUjvBCIDkVK2ZQ.jpg"},{"id":124049,"name":"Stephen Shea","role":"Linus van Pelt (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Af1ubOYQqluRRs93p9aC88STO9D.jpg"},{"id":124660,"name":"Hilary Momberger-Powers","role":"Sally Brown (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bcHimtCEdckLGfVGDBw6WYBICEG.jpg"},{"id":66897,"name":"Christopher DeFaria","role":"Peppermint Patty (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e7sPWVvfV9UfVNPegDlcf1z73su.jpg"},{"id":124026,"name":"Jimmy Ahrens","role":"Marcie (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xZPoI4TR1i4otxj2wkjzrTXXX4j.jpg"},{"id":94011,"name":"Bill Melendez","role":"Snoopy / Woodstock (voice) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/se2qF1kdaKTwDa69xjzA3j2gKaG.jpg"},{"id":2475021,"name":"Robin Reed","role":"Franklin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gciHwuN5xIlpQq8QGxByUaa80MQ.jpg"},{"id":124022,"name":"Vince Guaraldi","role":"Little Birdie Singer (voice) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m042USGgyQEVqxVVc2IuyWFDTkI.jpg"},{"id":34665,"name":"Peter Robbins","role":"Charlie Brown's screaming voice (voice) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5pLhG4JRs8oiTmyPTo7fkh2EfGK.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"È il Giorno del ringraziamento, Charlie Brown","overview":"Tacchino, mirtilli rossi, torta di zucca... e la banda dei Peanuts con cui condividerli. Questo sarà il più grande Ringraziamento di sempre! Il divertimento inizia quando Peppermint Patty invita se stessa e i suoi amici a casa di Charlie Brown per una festa di tacchino DAVVERO grande. Santo cielo! Tutto il nostro eroe può cucinare sono cereali freddi e forse toast. Charlie Brown è condannato? Non quando Linus, Snoopy e Woodstock partecipano per salvare il giorno (del Ringraziamento). Con amici così buoni, Charlie Brown - e tutti noi - abbiamo tanti motivi per essere grati."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Turkey, cranberries, pumpkin pie... and the Peanuts gang to share them with. This is going to be the greatest Thanksgiving ever! The fun begins when Peppermint Patty invites herself and her pals to Charlie Brown's house for a REALLY big turkey party. Good grief! All our hero can cook is cold cereal and maybe toast. Is Charlie Brown doomed? Not when Linus, Snoopy and Woodstock chip in to save the (Thanksgiving) Day. With such good friends, Charlie Brown - and all of us - have so many reasons to be thankful.","tagline":"Spend Thanksgiving with good ol' Charlie Brown!"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i1ibVD1WdMNcut7l1gsa6GF7fyv.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i1ibVD1WdMNcut7l1gsa6GF7fyv.png","language":"en","width":1590,"height":461},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dRd6K2wFHUaHnxAwOfGAJEl1lbH.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dRd6K2wFHUaHnxAwOfGAJEl1lbH.png","language":"en","width":1590,"height":461}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cJWKW4mDyqrsJv1FZb8RdXCRcp8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cJWKW4m